{"content":[{"c":["WINEPRESS"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["A sunken area (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.6.11","r":"Judg.6.11","rawR":"Judg.6.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.6.11","value":"Judg.6.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 6:11"},") into which the grape harvest was thrown and then trodden with bare feet, amid shouts of joy and traditional vintage work songs (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.48.33","r":"Jer.48.33","rawR":"Jer.48.33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.48.33","value":"Jer.48.33"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 48:33"},"; cf. ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.65.8","r":"Isa.65.8","rawR":"Isa.65.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.65.8","value":"Isa.65.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 65:8"},"). The red juice flowed through spouts into jars. Full winepresses meant prosperity; deserted ones spoke of destitution. The common winepress was a natural landmark (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.7.25","r":"Judg.7.25","rawR":"Judg.7.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.7.25","value":"Judg.7.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 7:25"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Zech.14.10","r":"Zech.14.10","rawR":"Zech.14.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Zech.14.10","value":"Zech.14.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Zec 14:10"},"); a privately owned one indicated the special care and efficiency of the vineyard’s owner (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.5.2","r":"Isa.5.2","rawR":"Isa.5.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.5.2","value":"Isa.5.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 5:2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Matt.21.33","r":"Matt.21.33","rawR":"Matt.21.33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Matt.21.33","value":"Matt.21.33"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mt 21:33"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["Grape treading provided a dramatic metaphor for the ruthless trampling by invading armies (",{"href":"?bref=Lam.1.15","r":"Lam.1.15","rawR":"Lam.1.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Lam.1.15","value":"Lam.1.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lam 1:15"},"). This vivid metaphor of battle is mingled with divine judgment (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.63.1-6","r":"Isa.63.1-6","rawR":"Isa.63.1-6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.63.1-6","value":"Isa.63.1-6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 63:1-6"},") and anticipates the Lord’s final judgment, spoken of as “the winepress of the wrath of God” (",{"href":"?bref=Rev.14.18-20","r":"Rev.14.18-20","rawR":"Rev.14.18-20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.14.18-20","value":"Rev.14.18-20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Rv 14:18-20"},")."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=VinesVineyard_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"VinesVineyard_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"VinesVineyard_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Vines, Vineyard"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Wine_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Wine_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Wine_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Wine"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Winepress","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jgs 6:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.6.11","rawQueryValue":"Judg.6.11","sourceRefExact":"Judg.6.11"},{"anchorText":"Jer 48:33","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.48.33","rawQueryValue":"Jer.48.33","sourceRefExact":"Jer.48.33"},{"anchorText":"Is 65:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.65.8","rawQueryValue":"Isa.65.8","sourceRefExact":"Isa.65.8"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 7:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.7.25","rawQueryValue":"Judg.7.25","sourceRefExact":"Judg.7.25"},{"anchorText":"Zec 14:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Zech.14.10","rawQueryValue":"Zech.14.10","sourceRefExact":"Zech.14.10"},{"anchorText":"Is 5:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.5.2","rawQueryValue":"Isa.5.2","sourceRefExact":"Isa.5.2"},{"anchorText":"Mt 21:33","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Matt.21.33","rawQueryValue":"Matt.21.33","sourceRefExact":"Matt.21.33"},{"anchorText":"Lam 1:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Lam.1.15","rawQueryValue":"Lam.1.15","sourceRefExact":"Lam.1.15"},{"anchorText":"Is 63:1-6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.63.1-6","rawQueryValue":"Isa.63.1-6","sourceRefExact":"Isa.63.1-6"},{"anchorText":"Rv 14:18-20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.14.18-20","rawQueryValue":"Rev.14.18-20","sourceRefExact":"Rev.14.18-20"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"971c95c4002a9dd4dacb3bc7ae976f197d1ccc7c7169e9ec14f9cf65e0e01311","sourceItemName":"Winepress","sourceItemOrder":48,"sourceMember":"Articles/W.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[{"name":"OneKindOfWinepress","src":"../Pictures/Pictures.xml"}]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Winepress","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Winepress","title":"Winepress","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}